  "description": "The AlgFormer/HoloFormer production standard: a stamped, append-only lineage journal that answers \"what was true when this happened\" without ever re-deriving history from current state, plus the canonical confidence-gated decode policy PrismStudio actually runs. Built to stop the same class of bug that has hit the hot path three times (alpha recomputed from a live constant, a regrow boundary invented from a schedule, a serve depth read from the wrong knob) by making \"derive from stamped history, never from ambient state\" the one thing this package does.",
